<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Shuttle Fact Sheet</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #fff;
      background: #000;
    }
    .container {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .background {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: url('https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/41881812845_7b436a6f86_o-1.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover;
      filter: blur(8px);
      z-index: 1;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    .snippet {
      position: absolute;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      font-size: 18px;
      transform: rotate(10deg);
      z-index: 2;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .snippet:nth-child(2) { top: 10%; left: 15%; transform: rotate(-5deg); }
    .snippet:nth-child(3) { top: 20%; right: 20%; transform: rotate(15deg); }
    .snippet:nth-child(4) { bottom: 15%; left: 25%; transform: rotate(-10deg); }
    .snippet:nth-child(5) { bottom: 25%; right: 15%; transform: rotate(5deg); }
    .content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 800px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #fff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00f;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .fact-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 10px 0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .fact-box img {
      max-width: 100px;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    .fact-box h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #0cf;
    }
    .fact-box p {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #fff;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .title { font-size: 24px; }
      .fact-box { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
      .fact-box img { max-width: 80px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="background"></div>
    <div class="snippet">First Flight: April 12, 1981</div>
    <div class="snippet">Total Orbits: 21,152</div>
    <div class="snippet">Top Speed: 17,500 mph</div>
    <div class="snippet">Final Mission: July 8, 2011</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h1 class="title">The Space Shuttle Program</h1>
      <div class="fact-box">
        <img src="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/676093main_1-shuttle_0.jpg" alt="Shuttle in orbit">
        <div>
          <h3>Overview</h3>
          <p>NASA’s reusable spacecraft, operated 1981-2011, with 135 missions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact-box">
        <img src="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/sts-1-landing.jpg" alt="Shuttle specs">
        <div>
          <h3>Key Specs</h3>
          <p>Length: 122.2 ft<br>Payload: 55,000 lbs<br>Orbit: 100-400 miles</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact-box">
        <img src="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/673137main_hubble_25th_full.jpg" alt="Achievements">
        <div>
          <h3>Achievements</h3>
          <p>Deployed Hubble, built ISS, first reusable spacecraft.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact-box">
        <img src="https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/41881812845_7b436a6f86_o-1.jpg" alt="Fun fact">
        <div>
          <h3>Fun Fact</h3>
          <p>Engines drained a pool in 25 seconds, with 37M horsepower.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
